OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786105098
OL,3,CPolice confirm that human remains
OL,4,Cfound near motorway belong to a man
OL,6,FPolice have confirmed that the human
OL,7,Fremains found close to a busy motorway
OL,8,Fbelong to a man.
OL,10,FGreater Manchester Police said
OL,11,Fofficers were called shortly after
OL,12,F11pm on Monday, 3 August 2026, after
OL,13,Froad workers made the discovery close
OL,14,Fto a bridge on the M67 in Tameside.
OL,16,FThe body is now known to a be a man
OL,17,Faged between 20-28 years old,
OL,18,Fapproximately 5'5" to 5'9" tall and of
OL,19,Fmedium build. The man's ethnicity
OL,20,Fisn't known at this stage.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/2
