OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786105098
OL,3,CPolice confirm that human remains
OL,4,Cfound near motorway belong to a man
OL,6,FThe road was closed between Junctions
OL,7,F3 at Hyde and 4 at Hattersley for most
OL,8,Fof the day, while detectives carried
OL,9,Fout their work at the scene.
OL,11,FInvestigating officers are continuing
OL,12,Fto work with specialist teams to
OL,13,Funderstand the full circumstances
OL,14,Fbehind how the body ended up by the
OL,15,Fmotorway bridge.
